                        "text": "var S=[[2.109375,2.269375,[1140,505],0]];var p=[1185,505];for(var i=0;i<S.length;i++){var s=S[i];if(time<s[0])break;var u=Math.min(1,(time-s[0])/(s[1]-s[0]));var k=s[4]==\"o\"?1-Math.pow(1-u,4):(u<0.5?4*u*u*u:1-Math.pow(-2*u+2,3)/2);var q=[p[0]+(s[2][0]-p[0])*k,p[1]+(s[2][1]-p[1])*k-(s[3]||0)*Math.sin(Math.PI*k)];if(u<1){p=q;break;}p=[s[2][0],s[2][1]];}p",
